WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.230
It activates when you send it 
from your hand to the graveyard.

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:14.990
It switches the attack points and defense 
points of monsters on the field.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:16.490
Here we go, Lua!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.800
Yeah!  It's our turn!

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.230
Draw!

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.050
Ancient Fairy Dragon's effect!

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.510
By destroying a Field Spell, 
I gain 1000 life points!

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.510
Field Spell?

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.250
You did it!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.810
When there's no Field Spell on the field, 
Earthbound Immortal's effect is negated.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.260
Well done, Luca!

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:51.010
Then due to Power Tool Dragon's effect, 
I add one Equip Spell to my hand.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.670
I equip the Equip Spell 
Rocket Pilder on Power

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.670
Tool Dragon and Pain to Power 
on Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:04.480
Battle!  Power Tool Dragon 
attacks Earthbound Immortal!

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:08.450
You're attacking with Power Tool Dragon 
even though it has fewer attack points?

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:19.390
Luca!

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:27.870
What are you thinking?

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.840
Did you choose to accept god's punishment?

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.390
No way!

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:38.630
By equipping Rocket Pilder, Power Tool 
Dragon can't be destroyed in battle.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:43.420
And Earthbound Immortal Cusillu loses attack 
points equal to Power Tool Dragon's attack points!

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.550
What?

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:51.560
Since Ancient Fairy Dragon is 
equipped with Pain to Power...

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:56.510
...it gains attack points equal to the 
damage I took from Power Tool Dragon's attack!

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:00.350
My pain changes to power!

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:04.200
Ancient Fairy Dragon attacks 
Earthbound Immortal Cusillu!

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.910
Eternal Sunshine!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.980
We did it, Luca.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.700
Thanks to you, Lua.  Now the spirits will-

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:49.580
I can't believe I lost!

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:52.910
Lua!  Luca!

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:59.890
Rudger, forgive me.  I was useless.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.430
Glory to the Dark Signers!

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:32.640
Looking over a vast distance

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:37.740
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:42.650
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:47.420
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.780
No matter how bad today is

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:57.770
There's still the faintest light

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:03.170
All I have to do tomorrow

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:07.230
Is light it myself

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:12.240
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:17.210
Even if I get countless scars

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:23.510
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.490
Today will never exist again

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:33.390
So I won't stop or vanish

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:02.360
Reincarnate!
Riding Duel that Surpasses Limits

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:13.630
Everyone is safe!

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:23.530
Luca, you did it!  Just as I predicted.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:27.000
That child saved the spirit world!

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.410
Luca, are you okay?

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.260
Lua.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:38.920
You did well.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.950
Luca…

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:48.380
Ancient Fairy Dragon and Regulus.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:52.330
What?  Are they Solid Vision holograms?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:57.070
No, we are not illusions.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.960
This is real?

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.580
This is why adults are lame.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:04.540
Luca.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.170
You fought well.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:11.390
Your power saved the spirit world.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:18.750
The spirits that Earthbound Immortal captured 
have safely returned home to the spirit world.

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:21.230
That means everyone is safe!

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:24.480
Yes.  Thank you, Luca.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:28.260
It wasn't solely my power.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:31.700
Lua also helped me with his power.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.670
Yusei too.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:37.160
Thank you, Lua and Yusei.

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:42.640
Ancient Fairy Dragon, will you 
battle the Dark Signers with us?

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:44.400
Of course.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:50.070
If the Dark Signers become more powerful, 
the spirit world will face danger once again.

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:57.360
After five thousand years, I will fight 
alongside you, even if it destroys me.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.830
I will also fight alongside 
you until my life ends!

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:10.050
Ancient Fairy Dragon.  Regulus.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:23.680
Mikage said the four towers regulate 
the previous Moment's spin.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.350
This is it.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.970
Luca, place the card.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:35.610
Ancient Fairy Dragon, lend me your power.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.860
We have to hurry up and leave!

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.990
What happened?  What was that dragon?

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:06.870
Huh?  They're not here.  What happened?

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.970
Sheesh, it's nothing!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:12.720
Like I thought, it was an illusion.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.850
There are three towers remaining.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.140
This time, it's my turn.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:23.830
Kyosuke Kiryu!  I'm coming after 
you at the tower of the giant!

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:41.960
Demak, you're the one who vanished?

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.990
I won't forgive you, Signers!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:03.460
Come out.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:13.370
Bommer, you planned to 
assassinate Director Rex Godwin

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:18.370
of the Public Maintenance Department 
during the Fortune Cup.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:24.040
The verdict for that crime 
is the death penalty!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.530
This judgment will now be enforced!

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.020
What is this?

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:34.550
This is the Gate to the Underworld.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.020
This gate connects to the land of the dead.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.990
Gate to the Underworld?

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:45.250
That's right.  After you die, you 
will gain new powers and life.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.700
As a Dark Signer.

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:49.430
Dark Signer?

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:54.600
Your inner fire yearning for 
revenge must still be burning.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:59.980
Remember your brother and sister 
who burned and disappeared!

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.030
Remember your destroyed hometown!

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:07.650
Godwin and the Crimson 
Dragon caused all this.

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.920
That's right!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:12.040
My hometown!  My brother and sister!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.120
It was all due to him!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:17.950
However, my mission isn't over!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:24.820
I planned to win this tournament so that during the 
ceremonies, I could publicly reveal what Godwin did.

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.970
However, that's no longer possible.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:31.180
Therefore, I'll get my revenge now!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:32.400
Look at this!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.680
My village was completely destroyed!

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:38.650
This is my village!  My hometown!

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:46.000
In order to resurrect the Crimson Dragon, 
Godwin used my village as a testing ground!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.450
And my village was…

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:58.180
All the villagers are missing, 
including my brother and sister.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:01.870
I will never forgive Godwin!

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:09.080
That's right.  Embrace those regrets as 
you die, and you will gain new powers!

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:20.090
Dying soul, listen to me.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:28.240
If the flames of revenge are still in 
your soul, then listen to my voice!

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:32.260
I'll give you one more chance to 
get your revenge against Godwin!

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:38.370
But you must become a Dark Signer and defeat 
the Crimson Dragon's servant, Yusei Fudo!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.240
I will defeat Yusei Fudo.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:46.550
For my brother and sister 
who were engulfed in flames.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:50.550
In order to get my revenge against Godwin!

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:53.590
Yusei Fudo!

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:58.530
You will resurrect as a Dark Signer!

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.200
Just wait, Yusei Fudo.

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.530
Just wait, Godwin.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.860
I will defeat you!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:47.440
If you also want to live, then run away!

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:50.410
But it might already be too late!

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:59.070
Damn!  I refuse to die!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:04.170
I won't die in a place like this!

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:16.070
What?  That's not fair!

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:18.080
Awesome!

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.820
Everyone!

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:46.470
Hey, everyone!  It's me!  You're here, right?

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:50.970
It's Crow!  Stop hiding and 
come out!  Stop messing around!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:53.080
It's Crow!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.650
Crow came home!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.580
Crow?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.950
Crow!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.420
You guys!

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.390
Thank goodness.  Thank good-

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:15.610
This has to be a joke.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.290
This has to be a joke!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.290
There you are, Dark Signer!

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:51.270
He's over there.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.580
Yusei?

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:14.560
Too bad, but I'm not Yusei.  But I know you!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:19.410
Bommer, I can't believe 
you became a Dark Signer!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.520
Who are you?

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:26.970
I'm Crow.  I'm replacing Yusei 
and challenging you to a duel!

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:50.630
You're not a Signer.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:55.920
Be quiet!  It doesn't matter 
if I'm a Signer or not!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.630
You took something important from me!

00:15:58.630 --> 00:15:59.980
Something important?

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.970
Don't play dumb!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:08.010
Due to your black fog, all the 
children under my care vanished!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:12.980
Why did you involve the children?  
They have nothing to do with this!

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:17.690
If that's how you guys operate, 
then I won't forgive you!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:19.690
Won't forgive…

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:23.080
I also can't forgive him.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.870
Even if I have to walk 
the path of death, I'll

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:28.870
do whatever it takes to 
get my revenge on Godwin!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:33.170
He made me choose this path because 
he killed my brother and sister!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:36.210
Then there's nothing to discuss.

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:39.290
If you want to defeat Yusei, 
you have to defeat me first!

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:40.360
How annoying!

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:43.280
I don't feel like fighting you 
because you're not a Signer!

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:47.520
Sorry, but I'm going to 
force you to accept my duel.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.750
Do you know what this is?

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:55.340
If you refuse to duel, we'll 
go to the afterlife together.

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.870
If you try to escape, I'll chase you down.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:04.700
Fine.  If you're that 
determined, I'll take you on.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.060
That will draw Yusei here!

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:13.320
Crow, I'll ask you again.

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:18.700
When the shadow duel is over, 
one of our souls will vanish.

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:21.470
Once we start, there's no going back.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:23.510
You're so annoying!

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:25.870
You took away my home!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.820
I don't need you to worry about me!

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.150
Fine.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:34.340
But there's one condition.  Autopilot 
can't be used in this Riding Duel.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.070
This is non-negotiable.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:42.340
In order to avoid attacks from the 
Dark Signers' Earthbound Immortals,

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:45.510
I have to be free to use 
my driving techniques.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:48.160
Let's go!

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.420
Field Spell Speed World!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.900
Set on!

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:55.080
Duel Mode on.  Manual Mode.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:04.660
That's the killer whale geoglyph!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:08.330
But there aren't any Dark Signers 
with a killer whale mark.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:12.640
Does that mean there's a new Dark Signer?

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:15.850
But it's weird.  My mark doesn't throb.

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:18.910
Does that mean he's not battling a Signer?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.210
Let's hurry!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:31.650
Without autopilot, the person who takes the 
first corner gets to choose who goes first!

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:32.690
Fine?

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:33.190
Yes.

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:35.190
So how do know when to start?

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:37.510
With this!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:42.510
Don't worry.  It's only a normal alarm clock.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.690
We'll start when that counter reaches zero.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:48.810
You fool.

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:03.250
Duel!

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:11.500
He has much more horsepower 
than my Blackbird.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:15.700
In order to win this duel, I 
have to take the first corner!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:23.150
What?  He's going to enter 
the corner at high speed?

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:24.840
But you'll find out who's better at braking!

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:28.010
I'm going in!

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:35.890
I win the first corner!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:44.420
You were bluffing!  This 
wasn't about braking!

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:45.740
Of course!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.230
If a machine that huge enters the corner at

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:51.230
high speed, you'll be pushed 
outwards on the way out.

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:54.200
Driving, like a duel, has secret strategies!

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:59.980
I get to go first in this duel!  I draw!

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:03.840
From my hand, I summon Blackwing 
– Shura the Blue Flame!

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.850
I set one card and end my turn!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.240
My turn.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:15.630
I summon Trap Reactor•Y FI!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:20.330
Then I activate Diving Exploder's 
monster effect from my hand!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.430
I send this card in my hand to the graveyard.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.470
The attack and defense points of monsters on

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:31.470
the field are switched 
until the end of this turn!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:35.710
What?  Switch the attack and defense points?

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:40.380
There's no way a non-Signer can defeat me!

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:42.920
Go, Diving Exploder!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:56.430
Trap Reactor•Y FI, 
shoot him with RR Cannon!

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:06.180
Why am I feeling an impact?

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.570
Everyone…

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:14.020
Crow?

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:15.160
Crow!

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:24.030
I can't afford to lose!

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:26.260
Everyone!

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.470
I...

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:40.880
It's too dangerous for a non-Signer 
to battle a Dark Signer.

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:44.400
I don't know who's fighting, 
but don't lose your cool!

00:21:56.910 --> 00:22:01.380
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:06.450
We will build our own future

00:22:06.890 --> 00:22:11.860
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:17.030
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.630 --> 00:22:32.170
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:37.740
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:37.810 --> 00:22:42.450
Even if it loses its light

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:47.720
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:52.190
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.390 --> 00:22:57.770
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:02.620
This journey has no end

00:23:02.870 --> 00:23:08.110
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.350
Hear my voice
